  "content": "<p>如果你想將這個模組放入你的模組包中，請隨意使用 :)</p><p>此模組允許在聊天中分享 JEI 的配方。<br>\n如果你在尋找 EMI 的對應版本，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-recipe-sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Recipe Sharing (EMIRS)</a></p><p>只需打開 JEI 視窗，點擊新的分享按鈕即可分享任何配方：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1626/768/screenshot-2026-04-11-193906-png.png\" alt=\"分享按鈕的位置\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1626/756/screenshot-2026-04-11-193025-png.png\" alt=\"聊天中分享的配方\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
